 "description": "The proxy gave up on a ping after 60 seconds, so the host has no usage for it. The next turn comes 8 minutes 46 seconds after the last one and reads 199,103 of 199,490 tokens. The ping is reported as a spend with empty usage and the library marks it unpriced (ping_result_unknown). The rescue is credited from the read on the request, which proves the entry was alive. The window shows a rescue and an unpriced ping, never a rescue with a silent zero cost.",
